<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net and shr exclude income from discontinued operations of $4.99 million, or $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
